          "management",
          "postgres",
          "kafka",
          "solver"
        ],
        "note": "Edits land in management, persist to PostgreSQL and fan out on rule.lifecycle to invalidate solver caches."
      },
      {
        "id": "execution",
        "label": "Rule execution",
        "focus": [
          "scheduler",
          "solver",
          "auth",
          "redis",
          "kafka"
        ],
        "note": "Solve calls validate API keys with auth, hit the Redis L2 cache, and publish rule.execution."
      },
      {
